{"created": "2025-05-14T17:11:40.565481+00:00", "modified": "2025-05-14T17:11:40.864885+00:00", "id": 15200179, "conceptrecid": "15200178", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15200179", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.15200178", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15200179", "metadata": {"title": "Hs27-CRISPRa-TFs", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15200179", "publication_date": "2025-04-11", "description": "<p>Processed dataset of all transcription factor CRISPRa perturbations within Hs27 cells (fibroblasts) from:</p>\n<h1>Comprehensive transcription factor perturbations recapitulate fibroblast transcriptional states</h1>\n<p>Southard KM, Ardy RC, Tang A, O'Sullivan DD, Metzner E, Guruvayurappan K, Norman TM. Comprehensive transcription factor perturbations recapitulate fibroblast transcriptional states. bioRxiv [Preprint]. 2024 Aug 3:2024.07.31.606073. doi: 10.1101/2024.07.31.606073. PMID: 39131349; PMCID: PMC11312553.</p>\n<p>in press at Nature Genetics</p>\n<p>Raw fastq files available at SRA: <span>PRJNA1108254</span></p>\n<p>This record contains aggregated, quality control filtered, and processed outputs downstream of cellranger including.</p>\n<p>1) guide umis per cell: <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/15200179/draft/files/fibroblast_CRISPRa_aggr_total_guide_umis.h5/content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fibroblast_CRISPRa_aggr_total_guide_umis.h5</a></p>\n<p>2) final qc filtered population with multiplets: <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/15200179/draft/files/fibroblast_CRISPRa_final_pop.h5ad/content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fibroblast_CRISPRa_final_pop.h5ad</a></p>\n<p>3) filtered singlets, processed with scanpy.pp.normalized_total and scanpy.pp.log1p. Raw counts saved in layer['counts']: <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/15200179/draft/files/fibroblast_CRISPRa_final_pop_singlets_normalized_log1p.h5ad/content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fibroblast_CRISPRa_final_pop_singlets_normalized_log1p.h5ad</a></p>\n<p>4) \"mean\" population constructed from the full regression model from overloaded droplets: <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/15200179/draft/files/fibroblast_CRISPRa_mean_pop.h5ad/content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fibroblast_CRISPRa_mean_pop.h5ad</a></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Southard, Kaden", "affiliation": "Sloan Kettering Institute", "orcid": "0000-0002-5017-0687"}, {"name": "Ardy, Rico Chandra", "affiliation": "Sloan Kettering Institute", "orcid": "0000-0003-4975-2177"}, {"name": "Tang, Anran", "affiliation": "Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center", "orcid": "0009-0001-5962-178X"}, {"name": "O'Sullivan, Deirdre", "affiliation": "Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center", "orcid": "0000-0003-4442-3112"}, {"name": "Metzner, Eli", "affiliation": "Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center", "orcid": "0000-0002-8957-9068"}, {"name": "Guruvayurappan, Karthik", "affiliation": "Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center", "orcid": "0000-0003-3791-8387"}, {"name": "Norman, Thomas", "affiliation": "Sloan-Kettering Institute", "orcid": "0000-0002-3755-4379"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1101/2024.07.31.606073", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "doi"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "normanlabmsk"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "15200178"}}]}}, "title": "Hs27-CRISPRa-TFs", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15200179", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/15200179", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/15200179?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15200179", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15200179", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.15200179", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/15200179/draft/pids/doi", "parent